  unitName: Marine Emperor Zeleste
  unitId: 20996
  unitNumber: 1613
  description: Long, long ago, Zeleste was one of the Six Imperial Gods who ruled
    before the Divine Ten. A greater god also known as the Marine Emperor, he ruled
    the region encompassing Sama and Palmyna. A god of chaos and madness, Zeleste
    was feared for the countless floods he brought forth. Even so, the tales of his
    wrath have been passed down over the ages and now form the basis of many widely-beloved
    fairytales. Zeleste also clashed with the deity known as the Ardent Empress routinely,
    eventually declaring all-out war under the pretext of territorial violations.
    However, the tales tell us that the combatants were both defeated by the deity
    that would later become the Holy Emperor.
  summonDesc: For a human to attempt to command me is as foolish as casting off to
    sea on a raft. Ready yourself for the consequences if you attempt it.
  fusionDesc: It seems even you understand, now. The sea is not always still... Its
    true form is shown when it rages and roars!
  evoDesc: 
